<title>UK: London gold fixes fraction easier, PGMs quiet.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes fraction easier, PGMs quiet.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $343.85 vs $344.00 previously. Fairly quiet little follow-through to Friday's buying on back of PGM surge. Faces resistance over $345.00.</p>
<p>SILVER - Easier at $4.81/$4.83, down seven cents. Speculative shorts building.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - $475.00/$480.00 vs $475.00/$500.00. Quiet.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - $235.00/$240.00 up about $16.00.</p>
</text>
